==Battleground==
*1 [[Bore]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Bore]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*2 [[Nimoy Bore]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Boraphim]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Bore]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**10 [[Nimoy Bore]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You should aim to use 3~4 [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]] in this stage, as well as good [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]], [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|Alien]] and [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|Angel]] [[:Category:Crowd-Controller-class Cats|crowd-controllers]] such as [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]], [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] and [[Talents|talented]] [[Sanzo Cat]]. [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]] works well against any of the enemies to help your meatshields stall until your crowd-controllers can either attack again or be redeployed. Also, bring good [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attackers]] such as [[Catway (Super Rare Cat)|Drone Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to deal with the wave of enemies that appear when you hit the base. For more information, see the video below.

